# ...except for the pi runtime extensions: the pi image installs their deps
# with npm, so their committed lockfiles pin what ships in the image (and what
# THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md lists; see scripts/generate-third-party-licenses.py).
!pi/pi-extensions/*/package-lock.json
!runtimes/subscription/package-lock.json

